                                "sense_id": "9ac5289a-32da-3c66-845f-29d82851fa72",
                                "text": "Let therefore Love, which is the Proxenet of Nature , the great instrument of conciliating hearts , beget in thee a return and retribution of Love, and never think of those streams of blood which so copioufly flowed from the wounded body of thy dying Lord, without a passive and melting spirit;"
                            },
                            {
